+    <section class="ops" id="ops" aria-labelledby="ops-title">
+      <h2 id="ops-title">Operations Queue Simulator</h2>
+      <p class="ops-intro">
+        Tasks run in small time slices, highest priority first, so urgent work jumps the line and the page stays responsive.
